                <l xml:id="m-bb58b954-548a-4b40-9263-d723a6937573" facs="#m-34bf0e1a-c170-4040-9b15-ba571ff0e16e" label="ambiguous">486</l><l xml:id="m-07ee93c0-a6d2-4c29-b22d-a74b00bb4703" facs="#m-6a8017a9-87f9-4c33-a773-f6a3cc6578e6" label="text-like">and Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-cb022cf7-e496-421f-91db-dd3257e81f0c" facs="#m-998d19c8-fa97-4c23-8f77-cc5eabe288af" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-797c6d18-9718-444d-b24a-c628355fbc4f" facs="#m-8302b51f-ae02-4e29-9346-74098ee88fe7" label="text-like">fi- li¬ is</l><l xml:id="m-ac23f34d-a111-40b8-ab00-f258db27d259" facs="#m-25ec7fdd-44b9-4644-8ed1-de4fc27fa212" label="lyrics-like">hómi-num.</l><l xml:id="m-499955b0-2be1-41c9-86dc-51ed19445cfd" facs="#m-cf97e9bf-5f35-4541-bd50-4c10fb6c18eb" label="ambiguous">jus</l><l xml:id="m-afd28f34-a6a5-485f-bcd5-a91475409a5b" facs="#m-97cae696-855c-4ea1-a9b0-da8ff6087bd8" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-e76fdfdf-899e-4867-af23-e118d811ecd7" facs="#m-243897ca-16a4-47d2-9795-7e3fea524367" label="ambiguous">h</l><l xml:id="m-1ed0afa1-0be8-459c-b7d6-35edb8e75a81" facs="#m-a8eaab11-9582-4578-9675-0cc1142560c1" label="ambiguous">iij</l><l xml:id="m-d0e253b6-ff75-4efa-9be3-6e4df5b7ebfe" facs="#m-8ef7701b-e604-4f78-bead-64b3b9ff853c" label="lyrics-like">V. Laudáte Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c184147e-b81d-44fe-a63c-46060575ca9c" facs="#m-a6b2b066-b864-47bf-bb18-ff204cb229b3" label="lyrics-like">L-le-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-0f0643e7-f71d-489d-b6cf-17dc0071d922" facs="#m-c434b4a6-4aa8-4474-a8e3-6f6a3bbd4198" label="lyrics-like">ómnes Ange- li é- jus: laudá-te é¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5210d83-4993-44d9-81e9-c354ca23e6ea" facs="#m-985d333c-10c5-4b0a-a2b7-103946405249" label="ambiguous">um</l><l xml:id="m-b84c15e0-9b98-4a1a-96aa-e8b283d79dd3" facs="#m-d0be15b6-034b-41dc-af26-211da8fd095e" label="lyrics-like">tes " é¬</l><l xml:id="m-145cb503-beef-403b-b334-73e959350c82" facs="#m-74d8a2a0-4c57-4093-8ff2-b22335b766be" label="lyrics-like">um ómnes virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-aed2cfb6-eadd-4fe5-88f7-97538e94e0db" facs="#m-b1c5233f-61a4-497c-be00-4ead02a99891" label="ambiguous">jus.</l><l xml:id="m-918492b0-46d5-4158-8c02-24df4e9ba38a" facs="#m-0e03b771-d1ff-4215-b5f3-cb2a16f28f63" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 2.</l><l xml:id="m-e839cfc0-639d-4cc8-bce9-c417ed4d12d8" facs="#m-1f8ec38c-0e91-49a2-9544-38e7e54a128a" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Núptiae factae</l><l xml:id="m-61c51e01-42eb-48c5-901a-fb1aae0b0740" facs="#m-6e71507b-9159-43da-ad32-0530ffebf45c" label="ambiguous">Et dicit eis Jesus: Haurite nunc, et</l><l xml:id="m-85bcd4f2-ef97-4f32-bfc7-b20f6e26dca6" facs="#m-11d35835-601f-4c18-af65-36a2fe3c0dfe" label="lyrics-like">L sunt in Cana Galilaéae: et erat</l><l xml:id="m-0fc4dc38-34e0-4e6d-bb0c-19ef5ed85155" facs="#m-061367b7-a913-4f9b-9361-8760feb2a55a" label="lyrics-like">ferte architriclino. Et tulérunt. Ut</l><l xml:id="m-d5014ac0-a9a6-45c5-8c63-3945b8e4a6b4" facs="#m-53ca6606-6580-4f46-a5fa-88e3f2c4de5b" label="lyrics-like">mater Jesu ibi. Vocátus est autem</l><l xml:id="m-464c2393-2183-45dc-a880-17076f722497" facs="#m-0974dd7f-3f9a-47cf-b870-e8c71b5e73ff" label="lyrics-like">autemgustávit architriclinus aquam</l><l xml:id="m-e9b07495-e31a-43cf-8caa-587dd8aea86f" facs="#m-eccfc133-260a-4e40-a9fd-0de6d19f867a" label="lyrics-like">et Jesus, et discipuli ejus ad núptias.</l><l xml:id="m-2a83b286-76e2-4fdb-8dcd-f1077f428834" facs="#m-c44e763c-e665-4c75-9ead-0e254aa2a0a4" label="lyrics-like">vinum factam, et non sciébat unde</l><l xml:id="m-5f754707-075c-4098-88d7-3c093e3edf08" facs="#m-bf9026de-0aa6-4e08-a592-a97f5d720ba5" label="lyrics-like">Et deficiénte vino, dicit mater Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-fd443a14-a401-416a-91b5-d66d805173d4" facs="#m-19148929-fe77-45f9-bb19-068949c6adbf" label="lyrics-like">esset, minístri autem sciébant, qui</l><l xml:id="m-0462af83-2df6-4f70-83ba-6699d002050a" facs="#m-3aa13b43-58dc-4e70-b6b9-555b36c72601" label="ambiguous">ad eum: Vinum non habent. Et</l><l xml:id="m-3474ff92-7adf-4f56-b6b6-502c26c18863" facs="#m-25ec291d-263d-424c-bb02-dfedba468391" label="lyrics-like">háuserant aquam: vocat sponsum</l><l xml:id="m-f8dfe90f-8c00-4685-8f6b-18dc2bccd7e4" facs="#m-efbcb298-e816-4449-863d-08afea33cd18" label="ambiguous">dicit ei Jesus: Quid mihi, et tibi</l><l xml:id="m-09de0216-1019-4e92-98ba-4f8bc47ec98f" facs="#m-a18498a4-d18e-4552-8d74-895e6e85bfa8" label="ambiguous">architriclinus, et dicit ei: Omnis</l><l xml:id="m-0a1752bc-e8de-4a2f-ba1b-3527d416bdde" facs="#m-95158d7a-a3c2-4fe3-a1e0-df117c35b821" label="lyrics-like">est múlier? nondum venit hora</l><l xml:id="m-ece25255-55c5-4cde-bd58-fef791f5bcd1" facs="#m-5eb96761-5c45-4af3-80cd-ea75b52260c9" label="ambiguous">homo primum bonum vinum ponit:</l><l xml:id="m-ea55235b-449e-4987-b9fe-f223e63b2b61" facs="#m-9c3dcadf-d439-4f10-ab5a-531152bf8924" label="lyrics-like">mea. Dicit mater ejus minístris:</l><l xml:id="m-818ba6a1-f4f6-4e9b-bb49-facab263644c" facs="#m-b094510e-8bd0-4169-ac85-0af93e1daf80" label="lyrics-like">et cum inebriáti fúerint, tunc id,</l><l xml:id="m-18db8f62-c0fe-4dab-9721-2aa704861dd2" facs="#m-929eae86-bd5b-4b34-abc4-5b9ffc2cc52c" label="lyrics-like">Quodcúmque dixerit vobis, fácite.</l><l xml:id="m-dd87401a-da34-47fc-8af8-599882761ae2" facs="#m-9ad820c2-b09d-4f78-97c3-d9972c37ab5b" label="lyrics-like">quod detérius est. Tu autem servá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8a0c27b-6d0c-48ff-8a6f-20bb33aa2396" facs="#m-d9f26a40-9728-4f17-ba12-e04a65cb7ec4" label="ambiguous">Erant autem ibi lapideae hydriae</l><l xml:id="m-97c0d23a-ac20-467f-bba3-d1085f6fb464" facs="#m-30b0a9c1-4144-4a17-866b-f4b599b743e2" label="ambiguous">sti bonum vinum usque adhuc. Hoc</l><l xml:id="m-4ee19776-9467-489f-8ff8-0c3b9460261a" facs="#m-e227f790-b9c4-41f9-8ae4-1f701b3ec7ed" label="lyrics-like">sex pósitae secúndum purificatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-63734578-8dd0-47a6-a338-da34dc8ee4f1" facs="#m-9de6f839-0731-4dc7-ae18-21fb7eb83a68" label="lyrics-like">fecit initium signórum Jesus in Cana</l><l xml:id="m-83a69bbb-dde2-4f5a-b3fa-1c343fecae5e" facs="#m-36ecf4cd-0078-48d9-bc14-f7659e06a524" label="lyrics-like">nem Judaeórum, capiéntes singulae</l><l xml:id="m-05c17ae7-1c93-4ca9-b1f3-fc1c9d5155d2" facs="#m-3f6275f0-28eb-4d68-ad69-bf5028be2642" label="lyrics-like">Galilaéae: et manifestávit glóriam</l><l xml:id="m-0cfcd549-c6ce-40c8-a798-cbd6053e6418" facs="#m-69a5af25-630d-415a-bf87-50df52368aa0" label="lyrics-like">suam, et credidérunt in eum disci¬</l><l xml:id="m-a7827d4a-2486-47bb-8228-c548ed22b385" facs="#m-4f54200b-bb91-42e5-9707-0555c2721100" label="lyrics-like">metrétas binas vel ternas. Dicit eis</l><l xml:id="m-fd8d5d8f-0445-4429-bbfa-e6ac878b6ad7" facs="#m-363f70be-f978-42d3-8c07-35fb690014ce" label="lyrics-like">Jesus: Impléte hydrias aqua. Et</l><l xml:id="m-3521b965-10d5-4e70-98fb-4f4469fa313c" facs="#m-aa38b5c8-74c2-4e6e-b65d-53c8bf5ff0a2" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-adc24c08-d9a8-4dda-8503-019c99c4c847" facs="#m-783ed6ef-60f1-4960-b952-1cbc5e42c12d" label="ambiguous">puli ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-d04470e6-0ef9-40a3-96aa-d082d9627fa6" facs="#m-f9557348-3919-4497-8fd9-71320a635a92" label="lyrics-like">implevérunt eas usque ad summum.</l><l xml:id="m-50e2e5c4-8dfc-48fb-ac68-13233a97491e" facs="#m-748842ca-4915-41b0-8866-e9b036c18455" label="ambiguous">orrert.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-242de8e7-0abd-4564-b934-9fa57ab032cb" facs="#m-faf408af-0830-43b7-969a-8b58088d568e" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-bb179716-5759-49f9-b028-9e0e0f121745" facs="#m-bd4f3f62-e146-47b0-951d-57480096305d" label="ambiguous">4</l><l xml:id="m-74d42ac0-c670-4abb-8ed7-585c7ee2a5df" facs="#m-290f17d9-bc72-4985-a441-b88a347d3889" label="lyrics-like">Ubi-lá-te“ Dé¬ o</l><l xml:id="m-ab698143-9d5d-4ff3-9bcc-a5829060f689" facs="#m-704f42e8-1f7f-4de6-bd1c-9a727bc9f50c" label="lyrics-like">sa tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3bcf636-4445-4db7-82b3-43afbb65b884" facs="#m-998d1fcb-1900-4bbc-bc68-b9a2cbfff100" label="lyrics-like">u- ni-vér¬</l></lg>
